# Tasks panel UI — protected (do not regress)

**User-confirmed (2026-07-30).** Read `memory-bank/tasks-panel-ui-protected-state.md` before editing Tasks toolbar or completed list chrome.

## Invariants

| Control | Rule |
|---------|------|
| Completed | Collapsible via `expand-icon-button` / `task-completed-expand-btn` (Bone Structure pattern) |
| Clear | Unloads viewport model via `clearModel()` when `currentModel` is set (Worlds Clear parity) |
| Clear done | Removes completed tasks from the list only (`clearCompletedTasks`) |

## Forbidden without explicit user request

- Dropping the completed collapse control
- Making **Clear** only clear the task list again
- Viewport Clear deleting task history

## Before merging touches

```bash
bash scripts/verify_tasks_panel_ui.sh
bash scripts/lock-it-in.sh --message "feat(tasks): lock panel UI"
```
